msgid ""
"Master switch. When off, the bound gesture and the Open Glimpse entry do "
"nothing – a quick way to silence Glimpse without unbinding its gesture."
msgstr ""
"Hoofskakelaar. Wanneer af, doen die gebonde gebaar en die Open Glimpse-"
"inskrywing niks nie – 'n vinnige manier om Glimpse stil te maak sonder om sy"
" gebaar te ontbind."

msgid ""
"Assign or change it under Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → (pick a "
"gesture) → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'."
msgstr ""
"Ken dit toe of verander dit onder Tikke en gebare → Gebaarbestuurder → (kies"
" 'n gebaar) → Leser → 'Open Glimpse'."

msgid ""
"Browse the maps, family trees and other reference images found in this book,"
" without losing your reading position. Tip: bind the gesture action 'Open "
"Glimpse' for one-touch access."
msgstr ""
"Blaai deur die kaarte, stambome en ander verwysingsprente in hierdie boek, "
"sonder om jou leesposisie te verloor. Wenk: bind die gebaaraksie 'Open "
"Glimpse' vir eentikatoegang."

msgid ""
"Also show the pages you've bookmarked (the dogear bookmark) in the Gallery, "
"rendered as page thumbnails and marked with a bookmark badge, in reading "
"order alongside the images – a quick way to keep a reference page a swipe "
"away. Off by default. Also available from the viewer's ⋯ menu (see Quick "
"Actions)."
msgstr ""
"Wys ook die bladsye wat jy geboekmerk het (die eseloor-boekmerk) in die "
"galery, as bladsyduimnaels en met 'n boekmerkkenteken gemerk, in "
"leesvolgorde langs die prente – 'n vinnige manier om 'n verwysingsbladsy 'n "
"swiep weg te hou. Standaard af. Ook beskikbaar vanaf die kyker se ⋯-kieslys "
"(sien Vinnige aksies)."

msgid ""
"Choose which actions appear in the viewer's ⋯ menu. Reset Rotation is "
"automatic (shown while an image is rotated)."
msgstr ""
"Kies watter aksies in die kyker se ⋯-kieslys verskyn. Herstel rotasie is "
"outomaties (gewys terwyl 'n prent geroteer is)."

msgid ""
"Double-tap the image to jump to the maximum zoom (centered on the tap), and "
"again to return to the fitted view. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Dubbeltik die prent om na die maksimum zoem te spring (gesentreer op die "
"tik), en weer om na die passende aansig terug te keer. Standaard aan."

msgid ""
"Swipe left or right across the image to move to the next or previous image. "
"On by default. (The Gallery's swipe-to-page is unaffected.)"
msgstr ""
"Swiep links of regs oor die prent om na die volgende of vorige prent te "
"beweeg. Standaard aan. (Die galery se swiep-na-bladsy word nie geraak nie.)"

msgid ""
"Pinch or spread two fingers on the image to zoom out or in. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Knyp of sprei twee vingers op die prent om uit of in te zoem. Standaard aan."

msgid ""
"Where Glimpse opens: a side panel (left or right) or, in portrait, a band "
"across the top or bottom. In landscape it always uses the preferred side."
msgstr ""
"Waar Glimpse open: 'n kantpaneel (links of regs) of, in staande, 'n band oor"
" die bo- of onderkant. In liggende gebruik dit altyd die voorkeurkant."

msgid ""
"Show ‹ and › buttons in the viewer for switching between images, as an "
"alternative to swiping. A button is grayed out when there is no image on its"
" side."
msgstr ""
"Wys ‹ en ›-knoppies in die kyker om tussen prente te wissel, as 'n "
"alternatief vir swiep. 'n Knoppie word grys wanneer daar geen prent aan sy "
"kant is nie."

msgid ""
"Let the ‹ › buttons and swipes wrap around at the ends: Next on the last "
"image goes to the first, and Previous on the first goes to the last. The "
"Gallery pages wrap the same way."
msgstr ""
"Laat die ‹ ›-knoppies en swiepe by die ente omvou: Volgende op die laaste "
"prent gaan na die eerste, en Vorige op die eerste gaan na die laaste. Die "
"galerybladsye vou net so om."

msgid ""
"Show a vertical −/fit/+ control in the viewer for zooming in and out, as an "
"alternative to double-tap and pinch. The middle button returns to the fitted"
" view."
msgstr ""
"Wys 'n vertikale −/pas/+-kontrole in die kyker om in en uit te zoem, as 'n "
"alternatief vir dubbeltik en knyp. Die middelste knoppie keer na die "
"passende aansig terug."

msgid ""
"While zoomed in, show a small overview of the image with a rectangle marking"
" the visible area. Tap the map to jump there. It docks to the zoom controls "
"when those are on, and is hidden at the fitted view."
msgstr ""
"Terwyl ingezoem, wys 'n klein oorsig van die prent met 'n reghoek wat die "
"sigbare area merk. Tik die kaart om daarheen te spring. Dit dok aan die "
"zoemkontroles wanneer dié aan is, en is versteek by die passende aansig."

msgid ""
"While KOReader's night mode is on, show images inverted (light lines on a "
"dark background). Also toggleable from the viewer's ⋯ menu."
msgstr ""
"Terwyl KOReader se nagmodus aan is, wys prente omgekeer (ligte lyne op 'n "
"donker agtergrond). Ook skakelbaar vanaf die kyker se ⋯-kieslys."

msgid ""
"Show the image's caption from the book, overlaid in the viewer's top-left "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"Wys die prent se onderskrif uit die boek, oorgelê in die kyker se boonste "
"linkerhoek."

msgid ""
"On a bookmarked page, show a label with the page number and chapter in the "
"viewer's top-left corner. Turn off to hide it."
msgstr ""
"Op 'n geboekmerkte bladsy, wys 'n etiket met die bladsynommer en hoofstuk in"
" die kyker se boonste linkerhoek. Skakel af om dit te versteek."

msgid ""
"How far you can zoom in, as a percentage of the image's own resolution. "
"Double-tap jumps to this level and pinch stops here. Higher reveals more on "
"detailed maps, but past 100% it is upscaling, so very high can look soft."
msgstr ""
"Hoe ver jy kan inzoem, as 'n persentasie van die prent se eie resolusie. "
"Dubbeltik spring na hierdie vlak en knyp stop hier. Hoër onthul meer op "
"gedetailleerde kaarte, maar bo 100% is dit opskalering, so baie hoog kan sag"
" lyk."

msgid ""
"While the viewer is open, a tap along the top edge of the screen opens "
"KOReader's top menu (only the top menu, never the bottom one) over the "
"drawer, instead of doing nothing. Turn off to keep the top edge inert."
msgstr ""
"Terwyl die kyker oop is, open 'n tik langs die boonste rand van die skerm "
"KOReader se boonste kieslys (net die boonste, nooit die onderste nie) oor "
"die laai, in plaas van om niks te doen. Skakel af om die boonste rand traag "
"te hou."

msgid ""
"By default Glimpse sets aside covers, publisher logos, ornaments and other "
"non-reference imagery, keeping maps, family trees, diagrams and "
"illustrations. Enable this to switch that off and see every image in the "
"book. (Individual wrongly-kept images can instead be ignored from the "
"viewer's ⋯ menu; wrongly set-aside ones added back from the Gallery's "
"Ignored tab.)"
msgstr ""
"Standaard sit Glimpse omslae, uitgewerslogo's, versierings en ander nie-"
"verwysingsbeelde opsy, en behou kaarte, stambome, diagramme en illustrasies."
" Aktiveer dit om dít af te skakel en elke prent in die boek te sien. "
"(Individuele verkeerd behoue prente kan eerder vanaf die kyker se ⋯-kieslys "
"geïgnoreer word; verkeerd opsy geplaastes vanaf die galery se Geïgnoreer-"
"oortjie teruggevoeg word.)"

msgid ""
"Silence the message shown when Glimpse is opened on a book format it doesn't"
" support (PDF, comics, manga…). Handy if a reading gesture sometimes "
"triggers Glimpse on non-EPUB files. Off by default."
msgstr ""
"Maak die boodskap stil wat gewys word wanneer Glimpse op 'n boekformaat "
"geopen word wat dit nie ondersteun nie (PDF, strokiesprente, manga…). Handig"
" as 'n leesgebaar soms Glimpse op nie-EPUB-lêers sneller. Standaard af."

msgid ""
"Remove the drawer's drop shadow. The shadow is a dithered gradient – the "
"main cause of e-ink ghosting behind the drawer – so turn it off if a ghost "
"lingers after closing Glimpse. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Verwyder die laai se valskaduwee. Die skaduwee is 'n gestippelde gradiënt – "
"die hoofoorsaak van e-ink-spookbeelde agter die laai – so skakel dit af as "
"'n spook talm nadat Glimpse gesluit is. Geen sigbare effek op LCD-skerms "
"nie."

msgid ""
"Switch between images with a quick, flashless refresh instead of a full "
"clear. On by default: faster and no flash. Turn it off if the previous image"
" ghosts through the next one – most noticeable on detailed maps and on "
"slower e-ink panels. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Wissel tussen prente met 'n vinnige, flitslose verfrissing in plaas van 'n "
"volledige skoonmaak. Standaard aan: vinniger en geen flits. Skakel dit af as"
" die vorige prent deur die volgende skyn – die opvallendste op "
"gedetailleerde kaarte en op stadiger e-ink-panele. Geen sigbare effek op "
"LCD-skerms nie."

msgid ""
"Glimpse caches its scan of the book. Use this if the book file was replaced "
"or images seem out of date."
msgstr ""
"Glimpse kas sy skandering van die boek. Gebruik dit as die boeklêer vervang "
"is of prente verouderd lyk."

msgid ""
"Also offer releases marked as pre-release on GitHub – test builds published "
"before a proper release. Normal update checks never see those."
msgstr ""
"Bied ook vrystellings aan wat as voorvrystelling op GitHub gemerk is – "
"toetsbouings wat voor 'n behoorlike vrystelling gepubliseer is. Gewone "
"opdateringkontroles sien dié nooit nie."
